cells:
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "Question: How can you make project in Sql?      \r

      Answer: In sql we have not project but we have case studies just like eda
      things we do . \r

      you do anlaystics in sql or make dashbaord in python or tableau"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "today we do case studies on zomato lakin ab tak haman sql ma jo concepts
      pade group or joins tak wahi tak ki knowledge area tak hoga.\r

      we ask question then we answer through by writing queries."
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: but when you learn complete sql you do proper analyatics case studies.
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "today we have 20 question and we have to answer than and we have 7
      tables on it. we actually create the database and tables. lakin ya
      approimate ha jasa asli ma zomato ka data hoga "
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "data is normalised .data divided into multiple tables.      \r\n"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "jab bhi aap sql ma case studies karo tho apko dimag ma ek mental picture
      honi chaya ki tables kasa connected ha . once apka paas mental picture
      hogi then kam karna bhut asan ho jayega.        \r

      aap deko ga pura time apko joins perform karna hoga . fir uska upar koi
      operation lagana hoga. agar nahi hoga tho join perform karna thoda muslim
      hoga.         \r

      so first you have `design of schema`        \r

      you make the `database design` or ER diagram"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "how can you persent the sql projects \r

      - blogs\r

      - kaggle notebooks \r

      - streamlit"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "so now lets solve the 20 questions to "
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "## 1. select a database"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 2
    languageId: sql
    value: "-- deko apko hamesa database define karna padta ha\r

      SELECT * FROM zomato.users"
    metadata: {}
